些 UI 检查点通过，A 全部失败。代价：失败后“处于 FM 但没有歌”的状态要处理好（A11/A50）。是否在客户端先判断登录并提示 `请登录后再试`：**不拦**。实测未登录时 E1 照样返回歌曲，如果像心动卡片那样拦登录，未登录环境下整个功能都用不了 |\n   498→| U4 | 点击卡片后是否自动打开播放页 | 自动打开 / 不打开 | **不打开** | Spec 只说“播放器自动加载”；与心动歌单卡片一致；Spec 步骤 4 同时检查底部栏，停在发现页更直接 |\n   499→| U5 | 已在 FM 中再次点击卡片 | 重新拉取 / 不操作 | **不重新拉取，暂停时继续播放** | 避免覆盖手动备份和多余请求 |\n   500→| U6 | FM 中的循环模式 | 照常生效 / 忽略 | **忽略**（播完总是下一首推荐），循环按钮在 FM 中被 `不喜欢` 替换（见 U16），退出后恢复 | Spec 要求播完“自动拉取下一首”，单曲循环、随机和这条冲突 |\n</file>\n<metadata>The file has 540 lines in total.</metadata>","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/acceptance.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec34/spec/acceptance.md","resolution":"absolute","endLine":500,"startLine":489,"totalLines":540}}}]},{"id":"6ad45250b72f63412bbea162","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":21129},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01PjgSZSXSArx2zqYShGjPes","type":"TOOL","toolName":"edit_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec34/spec/acceptance.md","new_string":{"$blob":"sha256:adcd4f632b1bf41f71c3f9a82a511fdaf023b8912104a94f3c4b093f2bffdc6f","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":1926,"compression":"none"},"old_string":{"$blob":"sha256:9c06b17dc17ee2413551f9a63b38c693c1e31235d6576cba146182ca542348d0","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":2334,"compression":"none"}},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/acceptance.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec34/spec/acceptance.md","resolution":"absolute","content":{"$blob":"sha256:cb0c1428c16e103472c88af1e9f1336a8192d85550c63d280ac7631d3add9374","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":54154,"compression":"none"},"originalContent":{"$blob":"sha256:b76f8b7c98bf623f84d0cb7f151b09602b6091e143bfd5a59162d840d309dc34","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":54562,"compression":"none"},"askReview":false,"diff":{"add":9,"remove":9},"runMode":"auto"}},"accept